          "_name": "features038",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features38\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen, 'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <select title=\"Amount\" name=\"cardAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\" selected>2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Image</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Height\" name=\"imageHeight\" min=\"3\" max=\"6\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"autoSize\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>The Lord of the Rings</b></h1>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text align-left mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                        The camera looks up at the character from a low position. The outstretched hand appears larger because it is closer to the camera, creating a strong sense of depth and perspective.\n                    </p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn align-left mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Get started</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/images-1.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row row-reverse justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 1\">\n\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Amélie</b></h1>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text align-left mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                        The camera is positioned directly above the character, looking down at her as she lies on the bed. This top-down perspective clearly shows the arrangement of the pillows, blanket and bed, making the overhead composition easy to recognise.\n                    </p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn align-left mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Get started</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/overhead-shots-amelie.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 2\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>We think in images</b></h1>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text align-left mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                        Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Donec egestas massa vel nulla gravida\n                        pulvinar. Pellentesque habitant morbi tristique senectus et netus et malesuada fames ac turpis\n                        egestas.\n                    </p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn align-left mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Get started</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"../_images/gallery/gallery02.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vxNKcGS9h9",
          "_anchor": "features038-2",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".row-reverse": {
              "flex-direction": "row-reverse"
            },
            "& when (@reverseContent)": {
              ".row": {
                "flex-direction": "row-reverse"
              },
              ".row-reverse": {
                "flex-direction": "row"
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
              ".image-wrapper": {
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "align-items": "center",
              "padding-top": "2rem",
              "padding-bottom": "2rem"
            },
            ".image-wrapper": {
              "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
                "padding": "1rem"
              }
            },
            ".text-wrapper": {
              "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "0 2rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            "img": {
              "width": "100%",
              "& when (@autoSize)": {
                "object-fit": "cover",
                "height": "(@imageHeight * 10rem)",
                "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                  "height": "(@imageHeight * 5rem)"
                }
              },
              "& when not (@autoSize)": {
                "height": "100%"
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "features038",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features38\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen, 'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <select title=\"Amount\" name=\"cardAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\" selected>2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Image</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Height\" name=\"imageHeight\" min=\"3\" max=\"6\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"autoSize\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>The Royal Tenenbaums</b></h1>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text align-left mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                        The scene is photographed from above, making the arrangement of objects clearly visible.\n                    </p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn align-left mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Get started</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/kfp8ftwvmetwlaunyzzk7x53e6v9-mcfzkkywjgpvblflat8mboxtamqbys9ldcnmseixr3lxitreeh11-6rpjopbd-n-9otkaibl4-tgyk28lr9m-no0axansd6-ycvo-tlznvb1mikfgg8t70x6ykqmyarr9oisu0ex3qt0ohpcolnkwjqoorbuclv5cxp.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row row-reverse justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 1\">\n\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>The French Dispatch</b></h1>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text align-left mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                        The overhead angle allows viewers to see the scene from directly above.\n                    </p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn align-left mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Get started</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/50s0js0ylxgcxnsaeytjegdunxuwz7rfwne-1bmclvj5rr114cp-fj2-jzbesdh5ihklfbc-vgsx0edq4q7pivcedrtk3xnal7pnayt1fpr0wkaefeyvwdawath36elrgouhtydtxfpvsmf9tsmicm3jds9yn-ayz32ebxafa1zjg5hopkw6nnjwd2fwfv7b.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 2\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>We think in images</b></h1>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text align-left mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                        Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Donec egestas massa vel nulla gravida\n                        pulvinar. Pellentesque habitant morbi tristique senectus et netus et malesuada fames ac turpis\n                        egestas.\n                    </p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn align-left mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Get started</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"../_images/gallery/gallery02.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
